<title>JAPAN: Takiron - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takiron - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 28.64		vs	   27.61</p>
<p> Operating	    1.31		vs	  934    million</p>
<p> Current		1.33		vs	    1.01</p>
<p> Net		  575    million    vs	  511    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.13 yen	  vs	    6.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     81 million	  vs	  79 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Takiron Co Ltd is a plastics processor affiliated with Itochu Corp.</p>
</text>
